WEBVTT

00:01:58.828 --> 00:02:02.436
It's full of panic and fear,

00:02:02.436 --> 00:02:06.232
and I'd heard the women wailing and crying

00:02:06.247 --> 00:02:08.540
in the desert.

00:02:08.540 --> 00:02:10.933
And I wanted to come home and take a break

00:02:10.933 --> 00:02:13.972
and maybe start over.

00:02:13.972 --> 00:02:16.824
I was not aware of any epidemic problems

00:02:16.824 --> 00:02:18.461
in America.

00:02:18.461 --> 00:02:21.748
In fact, I wasn't aware of any problems in America.

00:02:21.748 --> 00:02:23.828
In fact -- seriously.

00:02:23.828 --> 00:02:26.670
And in fact I would visit friends of mine,

00:02:26.670 --> 00:02:29.759
and I noticed that they had water

00:02:29.759 --> 00:02:31.772
that came right into their homes.